   "text": "the intent document \u2014 idea brief or problem statement \u2014 WITH its\nMEASUREMENTS. those numbers are what the package must answer, and what\npost-build conformance will measure against.\nthe QUALIFIED risks, countermeasures attached, from Test viability.",
